  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Safeguarding Standards for DRC.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to provide a strategic framework for Oxfam Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) Country Programme&apos;s senior leadership and the safeguarding teams that guides realization of Oxfam&apos;s safeguarding commitments, and core standards. The project aims also to avail Information, Education and communication materials that raise awareness to prevent safeguarding incidents among personnel, partners and against beneficiaries</narrative>
  </description>
